# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# The Codec2 service of the V4L2 decoders runs as mediacodec. A client that
# decodes through the platform's buffer pool hands the service the pool's
# message queue in a memfd that the client created, and the service maps it to
# take its input buffers. The platform grants this to mediaswcodec (see
# private/mediaswcodec.te); the service of the hardware codecs needs it too, or
# the decoder cannot read its input.
allow mediacodec appdomain:memfd_file { getattr map read write };
